{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Onslaught is a wave-based game where you survive an endless wave of bots and mechs, and the only way to survive is to kill to unlock new weapons before you're overpowered by the horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you survive, the more weapons you unlock, and the more enemies that'll spawn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't Die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you die, you lose everything, so make sure to watch your surroundings, otherwise you may get surrounded.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Save Your Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you <i><strong>exit to main menu</strong></i>, your progress is saved for next time, but if you die or start a new game, that progress is deleted. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bot Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/ba038ea001ec2255f17f4bb85f2e02b31c3523d1.jpg"},{"name":"Bot Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/fa3da1cb7be28f3e4228ee002408e2404232b332.jpg"},{"name":"Bot Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/0b7596c9408b5dbd5729ac59b4e21c26ba4a140f.jpg"},{"name":"Bot Nemesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/5001055368c941150a8faf90e4af42bb749cec5a.jpg"},{"name":"Mech Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/e56ce91a42d61cf7aaf29d4a58eac3acbfc432d4.jpg"},{"name":"Mech Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/b3366b9924312adcbaa252c4548306c90e610a8f.jpg"},{"name":"Mech Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3569050/571ce5f9fc3b6d39a8e0562e9254fa3336b86737.jpg"},{"name":"Mech Nemesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea